sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Visitor
    participant CDN
    participant API as Redirect Service
    participant L1 as Local L1
    participant Redis
    participant DB as Redirect Store
    participant Stream as Click Stream

    U->>CDN: GET /{short_code}

    alt CDN hit
        CDN-->>U: 301/302 + Location
    else CDN miss
        CDN->>API: Origin request
        API->>L1: Lookup

        alt L1 hit
            L1-->>API: Mapping
        else L1 miss
            API->>Redis: GET mapping

            alt Redis hit
                Redis-->>API: Mapping
                API->>L1: Populate
            else Redis miss
                API->>DB: Indexed lookup
                DB-->>API: Mapping or unavailable
                API->>Redis: Populate or negative-cache
                API->>L1: Populate
            end
        end

        API-->>U: 301/302 + Location
        API-->>Stream: Best-effort click event
    end
